      <tei:div type="colophon" subtype="notes">
        <tei:p>This is the formula of the prayer for the government established by chief rabbi Joseph H. Hertz in 1935 for the Royal Jubilee Service, applied to the reign of Queen Elizabeth by chief rabbi Israel Brodie in his revision of the <tei:hi rend="italic">Authorised Daily Prayer Book</tei:hi> (1962), p. 203-204.</tei:p>
